# Our vendor Adreno driver (SurfaceFlinger loaded from /vendor) queries QSPM for app-profiles.
# The vendor policy only allows vendor_hal_qspmhal_client, vendor_hal_qspmhal_server and
# hal_camera_default to query that service (see vendor_sepolicy.cil), so surfaceflinger is denied
# and the driver falls back to a generic GPU profile (SurfaceFlinger prints "renderer: Adreno (TM) 4XX"),
# giving GL ES 3.0, then Skia "no supported rendering path", then a SurfaceFlinger SIGABRT and a grey screen.
#
# Follows the existing convention in device/nothing/froggerPro/sepolicy/vendor/hal_camera_default.te:
hal_client_domain(surfaceflinger, vendor_hal_qspmhal)
allow surfaceflinger vendor_hal_qspmhal_service:service_manager find;
